_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423439003:1":{"text":"ママとパパの代わりに、そばにいてくれると思ったのに……ミーちゃんまで、あたしをおいてっちゃうの……？","source_cn":"我以为咪咪会代替爸爸妈妈陪着我的，咪咪，连你也不要我了吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85DEC0184F3255E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423439004:1":{"text":"この子、親をなくしたのでしょうか？「ミーちゃん」というペットだけが家族だったのかも……","source_cn":"听上去这个小女孩失去了自己的家人，和一只叫“咪咪”的宠...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19480A298D8223D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423439005:1":{"text":"ミーちゃんちゃんというのは、どんな子なんですか？","source_cn":"小姑娘，你的咪咪长什么样子呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8312852939DF56BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423439006:1":{"text":"黒くて、耳が尖ってて……","source_cn":"黑色的、耳朵尖尖的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCB5A33BE793D4E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423439007:1":{"text":"なるほど、ケットシーですね！私たちも探すのを手伝いましょう。","source_cn":"原来是小法妖呀！我们帮她找找吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB148D3B8A76556C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:哭泣的平民女孩":{"text":"泣いている女の子","source":"哭泣的平民女孩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/jp/ep4/quest_story/14234400.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234400","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234400","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1423440001:1":{"text":"うぅっ……ミーちゃん！見つけてくれてありがとう！","source_cn":"呜呜……咪咪回来了！谢谢你们找到它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDAD528D2DC8EDF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423440002:1":{"text":"待て！そなたの言う「ミーちゃん」は、我が家より失せた愛玩動物ぞ！何ゆえそなたの手に！？","source_cn":"站住！汝口中所谓“咪咪”，乃吾遗失之家宠！汝从何处得来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB81AD1DFA8952BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423440003:1":{"text":"……あの人、何を言ってるの？","source_cn":"他说的话是什么意思……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3569B133AE3B7AB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423440004:1":{"text":"えっと……ミーちゃんはあの人がなくしたペットで、どこで見つけたのか聞いてるんだと思います……","source_cn":"他说咪咪是他丢失的宠物，问你从哪里得到的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68DCD9517FF42D02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423440005:1":{"text":"ミーちゃんは、草むらで拾ったの。すごく痩せてて、あたしが大事にお世話したの……","source_cn":"呜……咪咪是我在草丛里捡到的，那个时候它很瘦，我把它照...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01EB28A4DABF34C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423440006:1":{"text":"戯言を！そやつは我が至極大事に育てておったのだ。さては貴様が誘拐したのだな！衛兵！ミ……あいや、我が愛玩動物を奪い返せ！","source_cn":"满口胡言！吾之家宠养尊处优，定是你蓄意拐跑！侍卫，替吾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4629DC775DA3FF9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:哭泣的平民女孩":{"text":"泣いている女の子","source":"哭泣的平民女孩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:骄傲的贵族男孩":{"text":"傲慢な貴族の男の子","source":"骄傲的贵族男孩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/jp/ep4/quest_story/14234410.json":{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234410","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234410","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1423441001:1":{"text":"わわっ……使えない衛兵め！や、やめろ、我……ぼ、僕を打つな！あ、謝るから！","source_cn":"哇……你们这些侍卫太、太没用了！别打我，我认错还不行嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F359D012EF3951E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423441002:1":{"text":"あら、もう変な貴族言葉は使わないんですか？","source_cn":"现在倒是不摆那副贵族的架子了呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F6E03954D9EF98E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1423441002":{"text":"あら、もう変な貴族言葉は使わないんですか？","source_cn":"现在倒是不摆那副贵族的架子了呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F6E03954D9EF98E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423441003:1":{"text":"わ、分かったよ……ごめんてば……","source_cn":"我、我知道啦……我错了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D2D5E04345C9815","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423441004:1":{"text":"本当は、知ってたんだ……親が、ケットシーを捨てたんだって……","source_cn":"好吧，其实我知道，小法妖是被家里的大人扔掉的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC27ABC7B934505B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423441005:1":{"text":"き、君がちゃんと世話してるみたいだし、こいつの新しいご主人様として、認めてやるよ……","source_cn":"既然你把它照顾得这么好，就让你做它的新主人吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEED7ADA25BD1342B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423441006:1":{"text":"よかった……ミーちゃん、これからもずっと一緒だよ……","source_cn":"咪咪，我是你的主人了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x452C47E468802B67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","d